5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I believe we should prioritize evidence of actual user satisfaction before deciding. I'll look into the post-occupancy review ratings and the survey findings in the older blocks to see where the real gaps are.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree that user experience is key. To complement that, I want to see how space is actually utilized. I will look into the booking data for specialist and general rooms and the timetable records on rooms out of service.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems we are focusing heavily on the present state of the facilities. To ensure our future plans are actually feasible, I shall examine the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale and the tender records.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to make sure we're being realistic about the costs! I'll look into the tender records over three budget cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,You all seem quite focused on the buildings and the money. How quaint. I'll look into the staffing posts since the hiring freeze and the bench technicians' weekly manual routines to see who's actually doing the work.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems we have a comprehensive spread of data. @Benjamin and @Kenji are covering the financial and historical side, while @Victoria and @Shunichi are looking at usage and labor. I believe this balance will serve us well.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Kenji"",""Victoria"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Indeed. By combining the operational data with the financial and human elements, we can avoid making decisions in a vacuum. I hope the records reveal whether our current scheduling can actually sustain the proposed improvements.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A most optimistic outlook, @Victoria. I merely hope the records are as honest as your intentions; history often reveals a certain... creative approach to deadlines that the current schedules might be masking.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, you're so mysterious! I just hope the numbers tell us the truth about the prices. I'm excited to see if what we plan actually matches what we end up paying!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Kenji, your enthusiasm for basic arithmetic is touching. I suspect the ""truth"" you're seeking is far less interesting than the reality of who is actually keeping this place from falling apart.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Let's keep the focus on the data. While the interpersonal dynamics are amusing, the goal is a facility plan that actually works for the people. I'm curious to see if the user ratings align with the usage data.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"That is a valid point, @Mizuki. If high-demand rooms have low satisfaction ratings, it suggests a critical failure in design or maintenance that we must address immediately. I am interested to see if those patterns emerge.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, a fascinating intersection of data. I suspect we may find that the most ""critical"" failures are often those that were promised to be fixed three years ago, yet remain stubbornly present. Logic suggests a pattern.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I bet we'll find some surprises! If the plans from years ago didn't work out, maybe we can figure out why and do it better this time. I'm ready to dive into those records!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Benjamin, your cynicism is almost as predictable as @Kenji's optimism. While you all chase patterns in spreadsheets, I'll be looking for the people who are actually exhausted by these ""patterns."" Let's see if the data remembers them.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we have all selected our data points, let's proceed. I look forward to seeing how the user feedback correlates with the operational and financial realities you all will uncover. Let's reconvene once we have the results.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I agree. Let us move forward and examine the findings. I hope the data provides a clear picture of how our space is utilized and where the scheduling pressures truly lie.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Quite. I shall await the revelations of our research with a mixture of curiosity and a healthy dose of skepticism. Until then, let us hope the archives are in a cooperative mood.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm all set too! I can't wait to see what's in those tender records. Let's find out the real story behind the costs together!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll be waiting. Try not to get too lost in your spreadsheets; some of us are interested in the actual human cost of these ""improvements."" See you in the next round.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
